Suggests: openssh-server
Description: PhiVoice AI: Claude Code and Codex sessions reachable by voice
 The host side of PhiVoice AI. `pvai run -- claude` runs Claude Code in a
 pseudo-terminal, `pvai codex` runs the Codex TUI on Codex's shared app
 server; the daemon (started on demand) knows the host's live sessions and
 lets the PhiVoice AI app on the Mac send prompts, answer dialogs, follow
 the conversation and hear the end of each turn, over an ssh port forward
 to 127.0.0.1:7470.
 .
 Per user, once: `pvai install-hooks` adds the hooks and the status line to
 ~/.claude/settings.json.
